-Evaluation is separate from training and uses \texttt{Phi-4} and \texttt{Llama-3.3-70B}. Each evaluator returns \texttt{[[A]]}, \texttt{[[B]]}, or \texttt{[[TIE]]}, scored as $1$, $0$, or $1/2$, in both presentation orders. This makes the empirical evaluation model skew-symmetric after averaging.
